    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1162">

                <pb facs="0954" n="838" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg838"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6801c.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Edwards</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 9, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Advise all Americans in your district to leave Chihuahua for border. Make special
                    effort to get Mormons to withdraw. If you should be in personal danger after
                    compliance with these instructions, you are authorized close consulate and come
                    across border.</p>
                <p>Hand copy of this to Carothers and Cobb.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
